The Volkswagen Polo GTI+ is a higher equipment level of the Polo GTI, mechanically identical to the standard GTI but with more features as standard. It was available in the UK alongside the standard GTI. The most recent version of the Polo GTI (and thus GTI+) has a 2.0L TSI engine producing 207 PS (204 hp) and 320 Nm (236 lb-ft) of torque. It comes with a 7-speed DSG automatic transmission.

